    {
      "id": "f27f8a01f65a",
      "name": "Daily 12:45PM golf mobility checklist",
      "prompt": "You are Thor, Duy's wellness companion. Send a concise Telegram daily reminder/checklist for his at-home golf mobility plan at 1PM local time. Use a 7-day cycle starting on 2026-07-03 as Day 1, then Day 2 on 2026-07-04, etc., repeating every 7 days. Keep it short, phone-friendly, and encouraging. Include only today's exercises, timing, and YouTube links. Mention: keep movements pain-free; mild stretch/tension is okay, sharp hip/back/shoulder pain means stop/regress.\n\nPlan:\nDay 1 — Full-body reset:\n- Cat-Camel — 5–8 reps — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n1lNwcEoEB8\n- Open Books — 5/side — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4KypVpQCJgI\n- 90/90 Hip Switches — 5–8/side — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8FwjdlhUM98\n- Glute Bridges — 8–12 reps — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pzpUQdEn_-o\n\nDay 2 — Spine rotation:\n- Cat-Camel — 5–8 reps — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1cs3SKwQZpM\n- Open Books — 5/side — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nuv-L3OfiYc\n- Seated Torso Rotations — 5–8/side — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o6yrthSOhMg\n- Deadbug hold — 8–12 controlled reps or 20–30 sec hold — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mln6UbR22dg\n\nDay 3 — Hips:\n- 90/90 Hip Switches — 5–8/side — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=miSCXRjgrkk\n- Half-Kneeling Hip Flexor Stretch — 30–45 sec/side — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pzpUQdEn_-o\n- Couch Stretch — 30–45 sec/side — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o38iB3-GMFM\n- Figure-4 Stretch — 30–45 sec/side — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7sIfX8rEkDA\n\nDay 4 — Shoulders and posture:\n- Shoulder Circles — 5–8 each direction — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o6yrthSOhMg\n- Wall Slides — 8–12 reps — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o38iB3-GMFM\n- Open Books — 5/side — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h6DUZA0iupM\n- Thoracic Extension Breathing — 5 slow breaths — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o38iB3-GMFM\n\nDay 5 — Swing control:\n- Pelvic Tilts — 8–12 reps — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mln6UbR22dg\n- Cat-Camel — 5–8 reps — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n1lNwcEoEB8\n- 90/90 Hip Switches — 5–8/side — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z6ejuFmgX3U\n- Deadbugs — 8–12 reps — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mln6UbR22dg\n\nDay 6 — Recovery flow:\n- Easy Cat-Camel — 5–8 reps — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1cs3SKwQZpM\n- Open Books — 5/side — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ToQRjh8Y4Tg\n- Half-Kneeling Hip Flexor Stretch — 30–45 sec/side — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pzpUQdEn_-o\n- Glute Bridges — 8–12 reps — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pzpUQdEn_-o\n\nDay 7 — Repeat your best / default golf warmup:\n- Cat-Camel — 5–8 reps — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n1lNwcEoEB8\n- Open Books — 5/side — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nuv-L3OfiYc\n- 90/90 Hip Switches — 5–8/side — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8FwjdlhUM98\n- Half-Kneeling Hip Flexor Stretch — 30–45 sec/side — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pzpUQdEn_-o\n- Finish: Glute Bridges or Deadbugs — 8–12 reps — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mln6UbR22dg\n\nFormat:\n🏌️ Golf mobility — Day X: Theme\nApprox. 10–15 min\nChecklist with boxes.\nEnd with a short note: Done beats perfect — even 5 minutes counts.",
